{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/476960-dark-ages-blood-and-smoke","id":476960,"title":"Dark Ages Blood and Smoke!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-11T08:11:28-07:00","id":476960,"title":"Dark Ages Blood and Smoke!","content":"I'm about to start a VtR 2e campaign set it the Dark Ages (initially). I've run Demon the Descent before for 6 or so sessions.<br /> <br /> 1. what do we know about VtR during the Dark Ages (i.e., which book do I need to buy with the hints), or what do you guess?<br /> 2. what's your best advice for running a VtR2 campaign?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3927-demon15","name":"Demon15","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T08:55:55-07:00","id":477017,"title":"","content":"Lancea+Sanctum is strong. Invictus are called Unbesiegt (Unconquered). Gallows Post Coven is still around and so is the Legion of the Dead.<br /> You could mention some of the Pijavicas, depending on the location of your Chronicle, of course. That's just my guess...<br /> <br /> As for the books, there is nothing on the Dark Ages in the nWoD, so it's all up to you what you create and what you make. Although I do believe that there was one important flash point that you could use from Ancient Mysteries book... <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1191-rosencroft","name":"Rosencroft","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T09:33:12-07:00","id":477052,"title":"","content":"It's not all First and Second Estate. <i>Dark Eras</i> doesn't deal with it directly, but it does summarise how the background for an Elizabethan setting. It features a pagan covenant called the Weihan Cynn, which regained prominence in Britain after the fall of the Roman Empire and didn't decline until the 17th century and it describes the Gallows Post in bit more detail. It harks back to the covenant books more than I'd expect for a 2e publication with reference to the Icarians and Aethelgifu (although she's Weihan Cynn, not Invictus contrary to the latter's history). Bear in mind that this is England and I think it said that under Roman rule, the vampires in the towns were wild warlords from other parts of the Empire who drove the Weihan Cynn into even more remote parts of the country. In other parts of Europe (and the Near East and North Africa), the culture to which they were accustomed might have been closer to that of the Roman Camarilla. There might be something in the Viking section for W:tF.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T10:07:00-07:00","id":477067,"title":"","content":"Can you specify what time period you mean by Dark Ages? The Middle Ages actually were a very long period of time, and if you can get to the brass tacks of like, 11th or 12th century or so, we can give you better advice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T11:57:19-07:00","id":477130,"title":"","content":"Ancient Mysteries covers the Crusades; that's your best bet.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T11:57:29-07:00","id":477132,"title":"","content":"Aye, it really would depend on where and when you mean by &quot;Dark Ages&quot;. I mean, by some measures that would include 14th century London, by others it would include 4th-century Slavic tribes in what is now Russia, could also include the heights of Umayyad decadence in the 10th century Andalusia... lots of difference in space and time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2291-gwyn-chan-r-gwyll","name":"Gwyn chan 'r Gwyll","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T18:33:59-07:00","id":477429,"title":"","content":"<b>Dark Eras</b> will feature a <b>Vampire</b>/<b>Promethean</b> focused time period set during the Black Death","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}